 "notes": "SIGNATURE. Every light in the chain is a sweep at a different height. Three enemies abreast is not a problem it survives, it is the problem it was made for.\n\nLineage: glaive — A blade rather than a hook: it cuts downward through a lane instead of sweeping across one.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 34.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
}
